task:
Eight poses of a narrator telling a story:
1. both hands pressed flat over his ears, eyes squeezed shut, wincing;
2. thinking: one hand stroking his moustache, eyes looking up;
3. amazed: both open hands raised at shoulder height, mouth wide open in an "o";
4. pointing straight up with one finger, mouth open, explaining;
5. "shh": one finger on his lips under the moustache, eyebrows raised;
6. shrugging: both palms up, shoulders raised, a doubtful smile;
7. writing with a pencil in a small notebook held in his other hand, tongue out in concentration;
8. walking to the right, mid-stride, satchel swinging.
